WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.379 --> 00:00:03.955
Unit one. Web Page Basics (HTML)!

2
00:00:04.959 --> 00:00:09.956
Hello, everyone! I'm Mr. Daniel, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:10.006 --> 00:00:13.716
Hi, Mr. Daniel! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.766 --> 00:00:18.012
Today we learn about Web Page Basics (HTML). Let's go!

5
00:00:18.861 --> 00:00:23.086
HTML. Say it with me. HTML!

6
00:00:26.552 --> 00:00:30.069
Tag. Say it with me. Tag!

7
00:00:33.631 --> 00:00:37.298
Element. Say it with me. Element!

8
00:00:40.775 --> 00:00:44.095
Heading. Say it with me. Heading!

9
00:00:47.575 --> 00:00:51.542
Paragraph. Say it with me. Paragraph!

10
00:00:55.051 --> 00:00:59.010
Attribute. Say it with me. Attribute!

11
00:01:02.534 --> 00:01:06.334
Structure. Say it with me. Structure!

12
00:01:09.809 --> 00:01:13.320
Markup. Say it with me. Markup!

13
00:01:16.813 --> 00:01:29.928
HTML is the markup language used to build a web page structure. A tag creates an element like a heading or a paragraph. An attribute adds extra information to a tag, like a color or a link.

14
00:01:29.978 --> 00:01:33.808
Now I understand. Thank you, Mr. Daniel!

15
