Element!

17
00:01:42.559 --> 00:01:47.864
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:47.914 --> 00:01:49.064
Structure!

19
00:01:49.978 --> 00:01:59.073
Did you know? HTML was invented in 1990 by Tim Berners-Lee, who also created the World Wide Web!

20
00:01:59.123 --> 00:02:02.131
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:02.825 --> 00:02:12.367
Think and answer. Why do you think every website needs HTML as its foundation?

22
